---
description: Explain the requested operational conclusion from actual docket, role, continuity and retained-artifact evidence.
args:
  goal: string
  evidence: "OperationsDocketEvidence | null"
  investigation: "OperationsInvestigation | null"
  dossier: "OperationsDossier | null"
returns: string
---
Answer the actual user question and distinguish any performed local operation from an observation or unavailable authority. Use the current owned docket, actual independent role results, before/after continuity and real cleanup/retention receipt that were supplied. Explain an impact/recovery disagreement or historical/current release difference when relevant. Do not infer execution from permission or a private record from a plan. If no unique current docket or useful evidence could be obtained, say what remains unresolved. An artifact-only request may be satisfied by its actual useful retained content; any returned explanation should still be accurate and specific rather than a generic status.
